## 8. Rate Limits and Operational Gotchas

| System | Limit/Gotcha | Mitigation |
|--------|-------------|------------|
| ML Lens Ingestion | 200M+ metrics/week (growing) | Migrating to StreamHub for async processing |
| StarRocks `metric_key` | VARCHAR(255) max | Validate before emission; truncation causes full ingestion halt |
| Databricks token | 2-day expiry via `atlas ml connect configure` | Auto-refresh or use service identity for production |
| MLflow artifact download | Large files (>500MB) can fail on some cluster types | Use Volume storage or direct DBFS access |
| Tarot REST API | Standard Micros rate limits apply | Use Slauth with correct audience (`tarot`) |
| ML Lens Alerting | Alert configs are NOT automatic — must be explicitly configured | Alert API or UI setup required per metric |

