## 7. Lineage Tracking

### What it is
Full end-to-end lineage support in v3: registry↔ ML Studio ↔ deployment. Captures the provenance chain of ML components.

### How it works
- **Components/Versions/Artifacts** → tracked at registration time
- **Upstream data** → training data lineage (via ML Studio workflow metadata)
- **Downstream deployments** → deployment versions modeled as components in registry

### Deployment Lineage
Model deployments are **components** in the registry, with deployment instances as **versions**:
- Deployment config files stored as artifacts on deployment version
- Version metadata captures: model version, deployment ID, region, environment, endpoint URL
- Status tracked via StreamHub lifecycle events → annotations on deployment version

### ML Lifecycle Events (StreamHub)
Registry publishes events on:
- Artifact Created (artifact ID, component ID, classification, attribution)
- Artifact Deleted
- Version Created (component ID, version ID, labels)
- Version Updated
- Compliance Verified

### Annotations for Eval Results
```shell
# Upload eval artifacts
curl -X POST "$TAROT/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}/artifacts" \
  -H "Authorization: slauth ..." \
  -F "file=@metrics.csv" \
  -F "metadata={\"classification\":\"green\"}"

# Create annotation linking artifacts
curl -X POST "$TAROT/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}/annotations" \
  -H "Authorization: slauth ..." \
  -d '{
    "type": "golden-set-result",
    "description": "convo-ai-evals:v42-- action91%, fuzzy 78%, p95 820ms",
    "artifacts": ["$ART_METRICS_ID", "$ART_JUDGE_ID"]
  }'
```

Annotations are **append-only** (no PUT/DELETE). Consumers use "most recent annotation of this type wins."

**Sources:**
- [Tracking Deployment Metadata in ML Registry + Lineage](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6266045137/Tracking+Deployment+Metadata+in+ML+Registry+Lineage)
- [Model Deployments Now in ML Registry & Lineage](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2026/01/15/6317041646/Model+Deployments+Now+in+ML+Registry+Lineage)
