## 2. REST API Endpoint Surface (Direct v3 API)

### Base URL
```
https://tarot.us-east-1.prod.atl-paas.net/api/v3/
```
(Environment variants: `ddev`, `stg-east`, `prod`)

### Core Endpoints Identified

| Operation | Method | Endpoint | Notes |
|-----------|--------|----------|-------|
| **Namespace CRUD** | | | |
| Create namespace | POST | `/api/v3/namespaces` | Body: `{name, description, owner: {group}}` |
| Get namespace | GET | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_path}` | |
| Update namespace | PUT | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_path}` | |
| List namespace items | GET | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_path}/items` | |
| Add item to namespace | POST | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_path}/items` | Body: `{componentId}` |
| Remove item from namespace | DELETE | `/api/v3/namespaces/{ns}/items/{item}` | |
| **Component CRUD** | | | |
| Create component | POST | `/api/v3/components` | Body: `{name, description, type, owner: {group}}` |
| Get component | GET | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | Ref = UUID or `namespace.path.ComponentName` |
| Update component | PUT | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | |
| Delete component | DELETE | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | |
| List components | GET | `/api/v3/components` | |
| **Permissions** | | | |
| Get permissions | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/permissions` | |
| Set permissions | PUT | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/permissions` | Replaces entire permission set |
| Get namespace permissions | GET | `/api/v3/namespaces/{ns}/permissions` | |
| Set namespace permissions | PUT | `/api/v3/namespaces/{ns}/permissions` | |
| **Artifact Upload (two-step)** | | | |
| Init upload | POST | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads` | Body: `{filename, data: {classification, attribution}}`. Returns `uploadId` |
| PUT bytes | PUT | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads/{uploadId}` | Binary body; Content-Type varies |
| List artifacts | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/artifacts` | |
| Download artifact | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}/artifacts/{filename}` | Direct download |
| Delete artifact | DELETE | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/artifacts/{artifactId}` | Requires write permission |
| **Version CRUD** | | | |
| Create version | POST | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions` | Body: `{description, labels[], artifacts[id,...]}` |
| Get version | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver_ref}` | Returns artifact list |
| List versions | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions` | |
| Update version | PUT | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}` | |
| Delete version | DELETE | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}` | |
| **Tags** | | | |
| Create tag | POST | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/tags` | Body: `{name, versionId}` |
| Get tag | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/tags/{tag_name}` | |
| List tags | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/tags` | |
| Delete tag | DELETE | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/tags/{tag}` | |
| **Annotations** | | | |
| Create annotation | POST | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}/annotations` | Append-only |
| List annotations | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{ver}/annotations` | Supports `?type=` filter |
| **Version via alias** | GET | `/api/v3/components/{ref}/versions/{alias}/artifacts/{file}` | Alias = tag like `production` |

### Two-Step Artifact Upload Protocol
```shell
# Step 1: Initialize upload (declares metadata)
curl -X POST "$TAROT/api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads" \
  -H "Authorization: SLAUTH <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "filename": "model.safetensors",
    "data": {
      "classification": {"dataType": ["None"]},
      "attribution": {}
    }
  }'
# Returns: {"uploadId": "..."}

# Step 2: PUT actual bytes
curl -X PUT "$TAROT/api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads/{uploadId}" \
  -H "Authorization: SLAUTH <token>" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/octet-stream" \
  -T ./model.safetensors
# Returns: artifact object with id, filename, hash, size
```

**Sources:**
- [Tarot Model Ingress Paths](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020f42e6ad0a6ee44319b956587ec99b127/pages/6974673626/Tarot+Model+Ingress+Paths)
- [ML Registry - user guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4594240174/ML+Registry+-+user+guide)
- [Downstream-consumer integration cookbook](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020e8e542e6fbb547dea43317e50413b60f/pages/7086703166/Downstream-consumer+integration+cookbook)
