## 3. Authentication & Authorization Pattern

### Auth Mechanism: SLAuth (Atlassian's Service-Level Auth)

All Tarot API endpoints sit behind the standard **SLAuth** proxy. Accepted principal types:

| Principal Type | Description | Compliance Status |
|----------------|-------------|-------------------|
| **ASAP issuer** | Service-to-service auth (e.g. `micros/<service>`, `ml-studio/<use_case>/<workflow_type>`) | Depends on issuer |
| **Bitbucket Pipelines build identity** | `pipelinesBuild:{repo-uuid}` | Compliant only on SOX-controlled branches |
| **AD employee** | Staff via `atlas slauth curl` | Non-compliant by definition |
| **AD groups** | Group-membership-based | Depends on context |

### Header Format
```
Authorization: SLAUTH <jwt_token>
X-Slauth-Principal: micros/my-service  (for service-to-service)
```

### CLI Auth Usage
```shell
atlas slauth curl -a tarot -e prod \
  -g<ad-group> \
  --<url> -X GET ...
```

### Permissions Model

Permissions are stored at **component** and **namespace** levels:
- **Owner**: AD group; always has write + ability to set permissions
- **Delegates**: Services/builds that can act on behalf of owner
- **Write permissions**: Controls who can upload artifacts and create versions
- **Deploy permissions** (UGC): Controls who can download/deploy data artifacts
- **Read permissions**: Open by default; can be restricted for UGC

```json
{
  "owner": {"group": "my-team-dl-ml-studio-access"},
  "permissions": {
    "write": {
      "asap": {
        "issuers": [
          "ml-studio/my_use_case/released",
          "databricks/atlassian-discover/prod/compliant"
        ]
      },
      "builds": ["pipelinesBuild:{repo-uuid}"],
      "employees": ["tchen"],
      "groups": ["my-team-dl"]
    }
  }
}
```

**Critical**: `PUT` on permissions **replaces** the entire permission set (not additive).

**Sources:**
- [ML Registry - ownership and permissions](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4593398179/ML+Registry+-+ownership+and+permissions)
- [DRAFT Permissions Tarot v3 / OSB](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4772173235/DRAFT+Permissions+Tarot+v3+OSB)
- [Tarot Model Ingress Paths](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020f42e6ad0a6ee44319b956587ec99b127/pages/6974673626/Tarot+Model+Ingress+Paths)

