- [Reverie: PIR Template](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/jai/pages/6621399196)
- [Example PIR structure](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~71202023649bbf794e4aa9b54887c3cd5c0d06/pages/6197487907)
- [PIR Quick Reference Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/IMPIR/pages/6490652719)
- [PIR Cheatsheet](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~63ad4e9115d69a40aa18f2d7/pages/6494273122)

