Based on all findings, the recommended wrapper for the MLE Agent tool:

```python
from atlassian_ml_platform.base_client import AtlassianMLPlatformBaseClient

class MLStudioClient(AtlassianMLPlatformBaseClient):
    """ML Studio Orchestrator API wrapper for MLE Agent"""
    
    SERVICE_AUDIENCE = "ml-studio-orchestrator"
    
    # === Job Submission (§2#3) ===
    
