## Finding 10: AI Maturity Framework (Assist → Embed → Automate → Orchestrate → Evolve)

### What it is
A 5-stage organizational maturity framework mapping the human role shift from "in the loop" to "on the loop" to "above the loop."

### How it works

| Stage | Human Role | AI Role | Key Indicator |
|-------|-----------|---------|---------------|
| **Assist** | User, requester | Responds to explicit requests | "AI helps when I ask" |
| **Embed** | Collaborator | Proactively surfaces insights in context | "AI is always there, offering help" |
| **Automate** | Architect, approver | Executes structured multi-step workflows | "AI runs our processes" |
| **Orchestrate** | Goal-setter, guardrail-definer | Coordinates across systems dynamically | "AI agents manage cross-system workflows autonomously" |
| **Evolve** | Strategic oversight, governance | Self-directs, self-monitors, self-improves | "AI improves our operations" |

### How it applies

Maps to the 3-tier model:
- Assist/Embed = All actions Tier 3 (human always confirms)
- Automate = Mix of Tier 2 (human at checkpoints) and Tier 3 (novel decisions)
- Orchestrate = Primarily Tier 1 (known patterns) with Tier 2/3 for edge cases
- Evolve = Tier 1 default with Tier 2/3 only for policy boundary hits

**Source:** [AI Maturity Framework: Assist → Embed → Automate → Orchestrate → Evolve](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~63749bef9e48f2b9a6109df2/pages/6823038854)

