## Synthesis: Unified Classification Heuristics for Skill/Tool Design

### Combined Decision Tree for `autonomy_tier_router`

```
function classify_action(action):
  // Hard overrides (always Tier 3)
  if action.policy_override:return TIER_3  // HIPAA, legal, security
  if action.blast_radius == "R0":      return TIER_3  // Multi-region/tenant
  if action.strategic_ambiguity:       return TIER_3  // Multiple valid paths with trade-offs
  if action.no_matching_policy:        return TIER_3  // Default-to-page
  
  // Decision tree
  if NOT action.writes_external:return TIER_1  // Read-only
  if NOT action.reversible:            return TIER_3  // Irreversible write
  if NOT action.single_entity_scope:   return TIER_3  // Multi-entity mutation
  if action.external_communication:    return TIER_3  // Sends to humans
  
  // Confidence override
  if action.confidence_score < 0.7:    return TIER_2  // Low confidence promotes to confirm
  
  // Blast radius check
  if action.blast_radius == "R1":      return TIER_2  // Elevated risk
  // Known pattern check
  if action.pattern_seen_before AND action.success_rate > 0.95:                       return TIER_1  // Known safe pattern
  
  // Default
  return TIER_2// Novel but bounded
```

### Unified Promotion Gate Criteria (L0→L4)

| Gate | Evidence Required | Duration | Metrics |
|------|------------------|----------|---------|
| L0→L1 | Sandbox operational; own identity; can recommend | — | SME agreement with output |
| L1→L2 | Audit traces clean; context engineering consistent; reinforcement signals captured | 2-4 weeks | Output acceptance rate; turns to acceptance |
| L2→L3 | Approval rate >95%; failure rate ≤ human baseline; policy framework in place; zero safety incidents | 4-6 weeks sustained | HITL approval rate; concordance score; failure rate parity |
| L3→L4 | Runtime containment proven; incident feedback loop operational; self-monitoring active;8+ weeks sustained | 8+ weeks sustained | Autonomous workflow completion rate; no correlated failures; improvement velocity |

