## 3. Feature Serving — Data Plane APIs

**Source**: [UGC Features Just Got Better! MLFS Online Serving is Live](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2025/06/30/5490056143), [RFC: MLFS Serving Architecture](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5218224830), [Read Features (Development)](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/agd/pages/5795966627)

### 3.1 Online Serving Endpoints

| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Single read (by FV) | `/api/v1/feature-view/get-features/{featureViewName}` | POST |
| Batch read (by FV) | `/api/v1/feature-view/get-features/batch/{featureViewName}` | POST |
| Batch write | `/api/v1/feature-view/write-features/{featureViewName}` | POST |
| Single read (by FS) | `/api/v1/serving/features/{featureServiceName}` | POST |
| Batch read (by FS) | `/api/v1/serving/features/batch/{featureServiceName}` | POST |
| Feature endpoint | `/api/v1/feature-endpoint/get-features` | POST |

**Request Schema (Feature Service)**:
```json
{
  "featureServiceName": "string",
  "joinKeyMap": {
    "cloud_id": "<cloud_id>",
    "product": "<product>",
    "workspace_id": "<workspace_id>"
  },
  "featureSelection": {
    "includeFeatures": ["feature1", "feature2"],
    "excludeFeatureViews": ["viewToExclude"]
  }
}
```

**Response includes SLO metadata**:
```json
{
  "result": {...},
  "metadata": {...},
  "sloInfo": { "eligible": true, "serverTimeInMs": 15.5},
  "errors": [...]
}
```

### 3.2 Performance SLOs
- **In-region single feature retrieval**: P99< 100ms
- **Target for non-wildcard feature services**: P99 < 100ms
- **Batch reads target**: P99 < 150ms
- **Scalability target**: 300K RPS

### How It Applies to Tool Design
For an AI employee's `mlfs_query_client`, the primary operations are:
- `mlfs_read_features(feature_service, join_keys, feature_selection?) → feature values`
- `mlfs_read_features_batch(feature_service, join_keys_list) → batch feature values`

These are read-only and safe for autonomous execution.

