**Source**: [How to create and validate a new Batch Feature View](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6152895771), [Shadow Execution Setup](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~40665330/pages/6727896888), [FeatureView](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6100075359)

