## Executive Summary

This research covers four key capability areas for the `cost_attribution_query` tool and `cost-stewardship` skill: (a) per-experiment cost attribution patterns, (b) budget enforcement mechanisms, (c) cost anomaly detection algorithms and thresholds, and (d) SageMaker→TEAMServe migration savings-estimator methodologies. Findings draw heavily from Atlassian's internalFinOps infrastructure (MOI/IAS system, anomaly detection pipelines, TeamServe migration data) and industryFinOps Foundation frameworks.

