## Synthesized Schema: Deployment Manifest for `deployment_manifest_generator`

Based on all findings, here is the composite schema:

```yaml
deployment_manifest:
  version: "1.0"
  generated_at: "ISO-8601 timestamp"
  generated_by: "ai-sre-agent"
  
  # Section 1: Intent & Scope
  intent:
    summary: "One-line description of what this deployment accomplishes"
    detailed_description: "Multi-paragraph description"
    linked_issues: ["PROJ-123", "PROJ-456"]
    non_goals:
      - "This deployment does NOT change the authentication flow"
      - "This deployment does NOT migrate existing data"
    # Section 2: Services & Files Affected
  scope:
    services:
      - name: "service-name"
        tier: 0  # 0-3
        version_from: "v1.2.3"
        version_to: "v1.3.0"
    files_changed:
      - path: "src/api/handler.py"
        change_type: "modified"
        risk: "medium"
    dependencies:
      upstream: ["service-a", "service-b"]
      downstream: ["service-c"]
      feature_flags: ["ff-new-endpoint"]
      config_changes: ["timeout increased from 5s to 10s"]
      
  # Section 3: Invariants
  invariants:
    - description: "All API responses must return within 200ms p99"
      verification: "canary_analysis"
    - description: "Schema changes are additive only"
      verification: "schema_diff_check"
    - description: "No customer data is mutated"
      verification: "code_review_attestation"
      
  # Section 4: Risk Classification
  risk:
    overall_class: "medium"  # low | medium | high | critical
    score: 45  # 0-100
    dimensions:
      technical:
        score: 50
        factors: ["touches database layer", "new API endpoint"]
      operational:
        score: 40
        factors: ["standard deployment window", "single service"]
      security:
        score: 30
        factors: ["no auth changes", "no new permissions"]
      business:
        score: 20
        factors: ["behind feature flag", "< 10% traffic initially"]
    blast_radius:
      users_affected: "10%"  # initial canary exposure
      regions: ["us-east-1"]# initial deployment
  # Section 5: Test Plan
  test_plan:
    automated:
      unit_tests: {status: "pass", coverage: "92%"}
      integration_tests: {status: "pass", count: 47}
      e2e_tests: {status: "pass", count: 12}
      load_tests: {status: "done", peak_qps: 5000, p99_ms: 180}
    manual:
      scenarios: ["Admin workflow", "Edge case: empty payload"]
      sign_offs: ["@engineer-name"]gaps:
      - description: "No chaos testing for network partition"
        mitigation: "Feature flag enables instant rollback"
        
  # Section 6: Rollback Plan
  rollback:
    category: "apply_previous"  # apply_previous | apply_previous_plus_manual | impossible
    conditions:
      - metric: "error_rate"
        threshold: ">1%"
        window: "5m"
