## Key Terminology for AI Agent Understanding

| Term | Definition |
|---|---|
| **PDV** | Post-Deployment Verification — validates service function before customer traffic |
| **SRM** | Safe Release Management — Atlassian's deployment safety program |
| **Canary Analysis** | Statistical comparison of canary metrics vs. baseline (Kayenta) |
| **Soak Time** | Minimum wait period between deployment stages |
| **Progressive Rollout** | Incremental deployment: sequential regions first, then parallel |
| **Blast Radius** | Scope of impact if the change causes an incident |
| **Feature Flag** | Toggle controlling feature exposure without redeployment |
| **Service Tier** | Criticality classification (0=critical backbone, 3=non-critical) |
| **Rollback Category** | Feasibility: apply_previous, apply_previous_plus_manual, impossible |
| **Intent Hash** | Cryptographic binding of the specific operation being approved |
| **Invariant** | A condition that must remain true before and after the change |
| **Change Window** | Approved time period for production changes |[0m
