- MLflow documentation: Model Registry Webhooks (mlflow.org/docs/latest/model-registry.html#webhooks)
- Atlassian "An abridged guide for MLflow" (hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/DTIE/pages/1691633396)
- Atlassian "Socrates vNext Tables for ML Registry Events" (hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5882009163)
- Atlassian "MLflow Integration in Airlock Flows" — patterns for MLflow event consumption

