## 4. SignalFM CLI: Detector Lifecycle Tool

### 4.1 What It Is

SignalFM ("SignalFx Manager") is an **opinionated Python CLI** (`bitbucket.org/atlassian/signalfm`) that bootstraps and maintains SignalFx detector Terraform code. Maintained by Jira SRE.

### 4.2 Key Commands

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `signalfm new` | Scaffold a new detector project from templates |
| `signalfm new-detector` | Add a single detector to existing project |
| `signalfm import` | Import existing UI detectors into Terraform |
| `signalfm update` | Apply template upgrades to existing project |
| `signalfm mirror` | Replicate detectors across services/environments |
| `signalfm sfxtfcheck` | Validate against policy (tags, naming, runbook URL) |
| `signalfm tflink` | Annotate PR with deep links to affected detectors |
| `signalfm cleanup` | Remove orphaned detectors |
| `signalfm este` | Estate reporting across all team detectors |

### 4.3 Template System

SignalFM ships Jinja2 templates under `signalfm/templates/` that produce:
- `main.tf` with `signalfx_detector` resources, default tags, routing
- `variables.tf` / `outputs.tf` with Atlassian conventions
- A bitbucket-pipelines snippet for CI integration

### 4.4 Validation Rules (`sfxtfcheck`)

The `tftester` framework validates:
- Required tags on all detectors
- Naming conventions (prefix, environment)
- Runbook URL presence
- Severity policies
- Team association

### 4.5 How This Applies to Tool Design

The AI employee tool can:
- Reuse SignalFM's template patterns (golden templates for detector types)
- Call `sfm init`, `sfm plan`, `sfm apply` via subprocess (for local dev loop)
- Implement equivalent validation logic (detect_label match, runbook required, team assigned)
- Use the `signalfm import` pattern for bringing hand-built detectors under management
- The tool surface should offer both "scaffold new detector" and "import existing detector" operations

**Source**: [SignalFM - In-Depth Code & Architecture Guide](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020d66bec030da6421bac4170e8c723d4d0/pages/6976748239)

