## Executive Summary

This research documents the complete ecosystem for SignalFx (Splunk Observability Cloud) detectors-as-code at Atlassian, covering: (1) the `splunk-terraform/signalfx` Terraform provider as the primary IaC mechanism, (2) the Sauron platform for CI/CD orchestration and state management, (3) the SignalFM CLI for scaffolding and lifecycle management, (4) the SignalFx REST API v2 for direct detector CRUD, (5) SignalFlow as the query language, and (6) established patterns from the responsible-ai-api reference codebase and other production implementations. The findings are structured to inform the design of a `signalfx_detector_client` tool surface for an AI employee agent.

