## 5. Production Patterns from responsible-ai-api (Reference Codebase)

### Architecture Overview
The `responsible-ai-api` service provides real-time content moderation and uses both SageMaker (for image moderation) and TEAMServe/Triton (for text/prompt moderation).

### Kill-Switch Pattern
```python
# Feature flags as kill switches
# Flag:rai_api_should_fail_open_when_model_timesout → fail-open on timeout
# Flag: rai_api_enable_fail_open_on_circuit_breaker_open → fail-open on CB
# Flag: rai_enable_teamserve_primary → switch inference backend
```
Kill-switch via Statsig dynamic config: block traffic per model_id, cloud_id, user_id, use_case_id, or principal.

### Circuit Breaker Pattern
```python
# responsible-ai-api uses: triton_circuit_breaker with fail_max=30
# Pattern: Resilience4j-style (count-based window)
# On CB open: fail-open (allow request) rather than hard-fail
```

### Per-Tenant Rate Limiting Pattern (from OPP-202605-03)
```python
# In-process token-bucket keyed on tenant_id
# Returns HTTP 429 with Retry-After
# Emit metric: image_moderation_rate_limited with tenant_id tag
# Ship behind default-off feature gate
# Ramp gradually with alert on 429spikes
```

### Feature Flag Routing
```
# Request flow:
# 1. Check is_gpt_oss_safeguard_enabled()? → GPT-OSS via TeamServe
# 2. Check is_prompt_moderation_teamserve_v2_4_primary_enabled()? → v2.4 via TeamServe
# 3. Check is_rai_ft_teamserve_primary_enabled()? → v2.3.3 via TeamServe
# 4. (else) → v2.3.3 via AI Gateway (DEFAULT)
```

### SageMaker Integration (Image Moderation)
```python
# Protocol: boto3 (AWS SDK)
# Endpoint: image-moderation-v0
# No feature flag routing (direct path)
# Scaling: min:1, max:3, instance:ml.g5.xlarge, threshold:180s, cooldown:300s
```

### SignalFx Detectors Pattern
```hcl
# Example from responsible-ai-api's morning status pattern:
# Monitors: error_rate by use_case, gRPC DEADLINE_EXCEEDED,429s, read timeouts
# Dashboard: SignalFx link in Compass component
# Alert routing: OpsGenie for Tier-1 support
```

**Source**: [Responsible AI API - Internals overview](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TrustedAI/pages/6714860307), [responsible-ai-api runbook page](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TRUST/pages/5927717332), [responsible-ai-api-archetype Compass](https://hello.atlassian.net/compass/component/8a954d95-c17c-46f2-81f6-9e6853177baa)

