## Research Summary

This research covers the patterns, fields, triggers, and deduplication strategies needed to design an `orbit_context_writer` tool and `orbit-enrichment` skill for an AI employee that "never solves the same problem twice." Findings are drawn from Atlassian's internal ORBIT platform, Jira AI's Distilled Knowledge system, Rovo Memory architecture, industry context graph research (Gartner, Glean, OpenAI), and the AI SRE/AutoSkill self-evolving patterns.

