## 8. Key Terminology / Taxonomy

| Term | Meaning |
|------|---------|
| Launchpad | Pre-prod model testing environment (originally SageMaker, now TEAMServe K8s) |
| TEAMServe | Atlassian's in-house GPU inference platform (K8s + ArgoCD) |
| Tarot / ML Registry | Model artifact registry service (v3 is current) |
| MSP | Model Serving Platform (umbrella term for deployment infra) |
| ML Studio | Atlassian's ML workflow orchestration platform (Databricks-based) |
| Component | A model entity in ML Registry v3 (has namespace, type, versions) |
| Annotation | Metadata written to a model version in ML Registry to signal status |
| perf_analyzer | NVIDIA's Triton benchmarking tool used for load testing |
| PRGB | Peer-Reviewed Green Build — compliance requirement for prod artifacts |
| DMP | Data Management Platform — artifact compliance validation |
| ArgoCD | GitOps deployment tool managing K8s resources |

