| Metric | Purpose | Used At |
|---|---|---|
| Time-to-Delegation | How fast human trusts agent | Success KPI |
| Bootstrap completion time | Onboarding efficiency | Phase timing |
| Context completeness score | Day-1 readiness | Pre-flight |
| Output acceptance rate | Quality signal | L1→L2 gate |
| HITL approval rate | Trust signal | L2→L3 gate |
| Eval success rate | Reliability signal | L3 maintenance |
| Confidence calibration (ECE) | Trustworthiness | L2→L3 gate |
| Shadow mode accuracy | Promotion readiness | Pre-L3 |
| Incident rate (agent vs. human) | Safety signal | L3 ongoing |

