## 10. Summary: Recommended Wrapper Design for AI Employee

| Aspect | Recommendation |
|---|---|
| **SDK to use** | `atlassian-ai-gateway-sdk` (Python, Generic Client mode) |
| **Primary API** | V2 Unified (`/v2/chat`) for model-agnostic routing |
| **Auth** | ASAP via service proxy egress (prod); SLAuth local server (dev) |
| **Resilience** | Circuit breaker (Resilience4j pattern) + kill-switch + exponential retry |
| **Rate-limit handling** | Parse `X-RateLimit-Type` and `Retry-After`; differentiate UPSTREAM vs gateway limits |
| **Metrics** | Emit to SignalFx: latency, token count, rate-limit events, circuit-breaker state |
| **Model selection** | Use canonical `provider:modelId`; plan for M4 tier routing |
| **Streaming** | Support SSE for long-running agent conversations |
| **Human confirmation** | Not required for LLM calls themselves; required for tool actions the LLM recommends |
| **Autonomous execution** | Chat completions, model fallback, retry — all autonomous |

