## 9. Key Models Supported (Current State — May 2026)

| Provider | Models | Via |
|---|---|---|
| **OpenAI** | GPT-5.x, GPT-4.1, o4-mini | Direct |
| **Anthropic** | Claude Opus 4.x, Sonnet 4.x, Haiku 4.x | AWS Bedrock + GCP Vertex |
| **Google** | Gemini 3 Flash, Gemini 3 Pro, Gemini 3.1 Pro | GCP Vertex |
| **Atlassian Hosted** | Llama 3.3 (70B), GPT-OSS (120B/20B), Phi-3, Mixtral | TeamServe |

**Supported modalities (V2 Unified)**: Chat completions with text input/output, tool calling. Embedding and image generation are V1-only currently.

