```bash
# Install skill
acli rovodev auth login

# Install RovoClaw sandbox
curl -fsSL <url> | bash

# Run evaluation
bash ~/.rovodev/skills/rovoclaw-eval/scripts/run_eval.sh --tag my-experiment

# Score the run (Step 7)
# Uses Rovo Dev CLI LLM-as-judge
```

### Output Schema
```
~/rovoclaw-eval-runs/
├── batch_results_<tag>.json# Raw RovoClaw responses
├── batch_status_<tag>.json     # Per-query batch progress
├── <tag>_eval.json             # Scored results (main output)
└── <tag>_report.md# Human-readable summary
```

### Metrics in `<tag>_eval.json`
- `quality_score` — Mean F1 across all queries
- `pass_rate` — % of queries that passed all conditions
- Per-query: `verdict`, `score`, `precision`, `recall`, `condition_results[]`, `notes`

