## 8. Summary: Mapping to §5.1

| §5.1 Requirement | Recommended Implementation |
|-------------------|---------------------------|
| **Official SDK/Endpoint** | `databricks.sdk.WorkspaceClient` (Python SDK wrapping Jobs API 2.1) |
| **Auth Pattern** | Bearer token from Micros stash (`DATABRICKS_API_TOKEN_{workspace_id}`); ASAP for callbacks to internal services |
| **Minimum Command Surface** | 6 operations: submit_notebook_run, trigger_job_run, get_run_status, get_run_output, cancel_run, list_jobs |
| **Request/Response Shapes** | JSON payloads with `notebook_task` + `base_parameters`; response includes `run_id`, lifecycle/result state machine |
| **Rate Limit Gotchas** | HTTP 429 per-workspace; concurrent job limits; circuit breaker after 3 failures; avoid duplicate submissions |
| **Wrapper Shape** | `DatabricksNotebookRunnerClient` class with circuit breaker, kill-switch, retry, SignalFx metrics emission |
| **Reference Codebase Patterns** | PCP `DatabricksApiHelper` (workspace resolution, status enum, async SQS polling); responsible-ai-api (circuit breaker, kill-switch, per-tenant rate limiting, SignalFx detectors) |[0m
