### 1.5 MLFS / Tecton — Feature Store
**[Satisfies: Feature CRUD, Feature Serving, Feature Monitoring, Online/Offline Consistency]**

**What it is:** Dual feature store: MLFS (in-house, replacing Tecton by Nov 2026) and Tecton (third-party, being deprecated).

**MLFS Architecture:**
- **Provider backends:** ERS (Entity Relationship Store) + Skybridge (Redis cache)
- **Capabilities:** Feature definitions, online serving, offline features, monitoring, compliance (data residency/retention)
- **SDK:** Available in Micros services for feature retrieval

**Key Operations:**
| Operation | Method |
|-----------|--------|
| Feature definition (declarative) | YAML/code in `tecton-feature-definition` repo |
| Online feature serving | MLFS REST API (all12 AWS regions) |
| Offline features | Via ML Studio |
| Feature monitoring | MLStudio UI + metrics |
| Feature CRUD | REST endpoints in MLFS |

**Tecton CLI (being deprecated):**
```bash
tecton apply# Applies feature definitions
```

**MLFS REST API (CRUD for feature service definitions):**
- `POST /feature-service-definitions` — Create/Update
- `GET /feature-service-definitions/{id}` — Read
- `DELETE /feature-service-definitions/{id}` — Delete
- `GET /features/online` — Online feature serving

**Performance Targets:**
- P99 latency: <100ms for online non-wildcard serving
- Redis caching support
- Batch reads support
- Latency budget guards

**Freshness/Coverage Monitoring:**
- Feature freshness monitoring via MLFS
- Feature coverage tracking
- Online/offline consistency through unified MLFS serving layer

**Migration Status (as of May 2026):**
- Tecton deprecation target: 2026-11-30
- MLFS serving GA (Tecton features via MLFS API)
- Streaming feature views in progress (ATLAS-123028)

**Auth Pattern:** ASAP for service-to-service; MLFS inherits from Micros ecosystem.

**Source:** [MLFS & Tecton](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TCH1/pages/5576660473/MLFS+Tecton), [PSA: ML Platform is deprecating Tecton](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2025/12/03/6159139910/PSA+ML+Platform+is+deprecating+Tecton), [Tecton to MLFS Migration Roadmap](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6068686994/Tecton+to+MLFS+Migration+Roadmap)

