**[Satisfies: Model Inference (GPU), LLM Serving, Model Deployment]**

**What it is:** Atlassian's in-house GPU-backed model serving on Kubernetes (KITT). Supports Triton, TensorRT-LLM, vLLM, PyTorch.

**Endpoint Patterns:**
