Source extraction (role-doc §4.1, W0 §3.5): The template names four headline
gates — privacy review, rollback plan, drift monitor, alerting — but §10.5
designates "launch go-no-go" as 🔴 requiring a mechanically checkable rubric.
The skill must BE that rubric.

Operating model: 🟢 enforcement, 🔴 final decision. Fail-closed (missing
evidence = BLOCK, missing wrapper = ESCALATE). Idempotent, audit-logged,
pinned to model version + commit SHA + dataset hash.

32 enforceable gates across 4 phases:

 • Phase A — Pre-experiment (6): problem framing, privacy review, data
   lineage, pre-analysis+lit synth, DQ audit ≤7 days, compute budget.
 • Phase B — Model quality (10): multi-seed ≥5, k-fold ≥5, calibration (ECE
   ≤0.05), fairness/slice parity (Δ ≤2%), 100% failure-case categorization
   (5-category taxonomy), mandatory ablations+interactions, statistical
   significance with multiple-comparison correction, Bayesian HPO statistical
   convergence (Optimus Prime), reproducibility, architecture comparison
   report.
 • Phase C — Production-ready (10): rollback rehearsed, canary/shadow plan,
   drift monitor (cosine ≥0.60 NLP), SignalFx+JSM alerting, SLOs-as-code,
   ML-Engine circuit breaker (20%/60s), kill-switch flag, capacity/2× load
   test, OOD/red-team+safetensors, cost guardrail.
 • Phase D — Governance (6): deployment manifest schema, model card, runbook,
   policy compliance, ORBIT enrichment, reviewer sign-off.

Skill→tool map: Combines new wrapper tools (mlflow_client,
tarot_registry_client, ml_lens_client, signalfx_detector_iac,
teamserve_deploy_client, launchpad_validate, responsible_ai_api_ops,
ml_studio_client, tecton_mlfs_client) with existing MCP tools (atlassian
Jira/Confluence, bitbucket PR/repo/pipelines, switcheroo for flags, slack for
notifications).

Non-negotiable AI-native gates explicitly encoded with defaults (multi-seed
≥5, k≥5 folds, ECE ≤0.05, slice Δ ≤2%, 100% failure categorization,
ablations+interactions, HPO convergence, ML-Engine 20%/60s circuit-breaker,
safetensors).


Artifacts produced: launch-review.json manifest (Tarot lineage), Confluence
Launch Review Report, Bitbucket PR comment, Jira escalation ticket on 🔴,
Slack notification. Integration patterns: PR-gated default, SOP-1/2/3
handoffs, rollback path, quarterly re-attestation. Includes traceability
matrix back to every cited role-doc section.
