Operating model: 🟢 enforcement, 🔴 final decision. Fail-closed (missing
evidence = BLOCK, missing wrapper = ESCALATE). Idempotent, audit-logged,
pinned to model version + commit SHA + dataset hash.

32 enforceable gates across 4 phases:

 • Phase A — Pre-experiment (6): problem framing, privacy review, data
   lineage, pre-analysis+lit synth, DQ audit ≤7 days, compute budget.
 • Phase B — Model quality (10): multi-seed ≥5, k-fold ≥5, calibration (ECE
   ≤0.05), fairness/slice parity (Δ ≤2%), 100% failure-case categorization
   (5-category taxonomy), mandatory ablations+interactions, statistical
