Role-doc anchors (extracted from §10.2 + §6 SOP-1/2 + §306):

 • §10.2 item 1 is the non-negotiable gate: "Bayesian search to statistical 
   convergence, not plateau; optimization-surface visualizations; convergence
   verification; sensitivity analysis on every hyperparameter."
 • Companion gates (§10.2 item 6): never select hp on test data, never
   single-seed, always calibration+CIs+fairness, always document rejected
   alternatives.
 • SOP-1 step 3 / SOP-2 step 5: Optimus Prime invoked per-architecture inside
   a 2-10-way parallel architecture search.
 • §306: convergence is also the cost-control trigger — auto-release GPUs on
   convergence.

9-step SOP with autonomy tags (0 Pre-flight, 1 Budget+criteria declaration, 2
Sobol warm-start, 3 Bayesian iteration with qEI/logEI batch, 4 Continuous
convergence test, 5 Finalist re-eval with fresh seeds, 6 fANOVA sensitivity on
every hp, 7 Surface visualizations, 8 Tarot register + ORBIT append + GPU
release, 9 Escalation). Every step is fail-closed 🟢 except step 9.

Statistical convergence — 6 criteria all required (the "not plateau" gate):

 • C1: EI-exhaustion EI* < 1e-3·|best| over 25 trials (Bull 2011)
 • C2: Integrated posterior variance ratio < 0.05 (Picheny 2013)
 • C3: Finalist bootstrap-CI width < 2% + no surrogate-predicted better point
   at 2σ
 • C4: GP length-scale drift < 10% over window
 • C5: Top-1 vs top-2 separated at p<0.05 Bonferroni-corrected with ≥5 seeds
   (Bouthillier 2021)
 • C6: No top-quartile trial on a bound (search-space adequacy)
 • Plateau-alone is explicitly forbidden as the sole gate.

Skill-step → tool-call map: depends on 3 new Subtask-2 wrappers
(ml_studio_client, mlflow_client, tarot_registry_client) + Subtask-3 wrappers
(cost_attribution_query, orbit_context_writer, escalation_router). Existing
MCPs already cover escalation/comms (atlassian.create_jira_issue,
atlassian.create_confluence_page, slack.channel_create_message, bitbucket for
search-space config PRs, teamwork_graph for cross-linkage).

Gaps flagged: Optimus Prime API surface not in local artifacts (Subtask 2 must
confirm); multi-objective BO defaults to qNEHVI; low-budget regime needs
explicit caveat path; fANOVA on conditional spaces falls back to permutation
importance.

Citations: Frazier 2018, Snoek 2012, Bull 2011, Hutter 2014 (fANOVA),
Bouthillier 2021, Henderson 2018, Picheny 2013, Kandasamy 2018, Eriksson 2019
(TuRBO), Garnett 2023 textbook, BoTorch/Optuna docs.


