You are responsible for producing skills, tools, and knowledge blocks related ONLY to the scope described in the creation request above. Do NOT produce deliverables for scopes outside this request, even if your research uncovers them. Other workers handle other scopes — duplicating their work creates conflicts and may produce incomplete versions.

