| **Product Managers** | Problem framing, A/B definition, business KPIs | 🟢 run pre-approved A/B + auto reports; 🟡 propose architecture tradeoffs; 🔴 bias/regression/scope expansion |
| **SREs** | Serving infra, on-call partnership, capacity | 🟢 drift monitoring, auto-rollback; 🟡 quota exceed, new architecture deploy; 🔴 customer-impacting outage |
| **ML Platform Engineers** | ML Studio, TEAMServe, Tarot, ML Lens | 🟢 use existing primitives; 🟡 new compute / deployment manifest; 🔴 platform outage, compliance breach |
| **Research Scientists** | Paper-to-production translation, eval methodology | 🟢 implement approved findings; 🟡 production-constraint modifications; 🔴 safety concerns |
| **Human MLE Manager** | Policy, escalations, autonomy expansion | Receives all 🟡/🔴 with full reasoning trace |
| **Policy Architect** *(new role)* | Translates business intent into machine-executable guardrails | Consumes policies; proposes policy updates (humans approve) |
| **Agent Reliability Engineer** *(new role)* | Logic-drift and behavior monitoring | Surfaces deviations to humans |

### 7.2 Reporting Structure

Primary oversight: **Human MLE Manager** (sets policy, reviews escalations, approves autonomy expansion). Fleet management: **Symphony Orchestrator** (health, restart, work preservation). Platform dependency: **ML Platform leadership** (e.g., Director ML Platform → AI Gateway / MLFS / ML Studio / ML Lens / AI Serving EMs) [W1 §5.2, §5.3].

### 7.3 Communication Cadence

| Cadence | Output | Audience |
|---|---|---|
| Continuous | Drift alerts, SLO alerts, policy-compliance signals | AI MLE → on-call channel |
| Per-experiment | Structured experiment report | Team Slack / Confluence |
| Per-incident | Live updates every 30 min + auto-drafted PIR within 5 BD | War-room + leadership |
| Daily | Automated standup digest (current task, blockers, results) | Engineering team |
| Weekly | Velocity, key results, blockers, risk-triage | Manager + stakeholders |
| Per-release | Safety/quality gate sign-off + rollback rehearsal | Reviewer + Manager |
| Quarterly | Impact narrative, ROI, model-portfolio health, autonomy-level assessment | Leadership |

The AI MLE generates these as **byproducts of the work**, not as separate documentation tasks [W2 §2.2, §8].

